# Retired help articles (docs/specs/018-help/help-app.md "Retired articles"). Each retired URL moves
# permanently to the nearest live page, so search results and old links keep landing.
# The router strips /help before forwarding and puts it back on a relative Location, so paths here
# carry no /help prefix. Workers Static Assets reads this file from out/ (Next copies public/).
# lib/retired-articles.test.ts pins every target to a live page.

/self-hosting / 301
/self-hosting/ / 301
/self-hosting/* / 301

# The Slide Deck (Presentation mode) was retired on 25 October 2026; its guides move to the Selection Modes index.
/selection-modes/slide-deck /selection-modes/ 301
/selection-modes/slide-deck/ /selection-modes/ 301
/selection-modes/slide-deck/* /selection-modes/ 301
# The isometric view left this product on 2026-10-25 (docs/specs/008-canvas/canvas-and-palette.md "Retired
# features"); its article's old URL lands on the Selection Modes page. livediagram keeps the view.
/selection-modes/isometric-mode /selection-modes/ 301
/selection-modes/isometric-mode/ /selection-modes/ 301
# The Layers panel was retired on 2026-11-08 (docs/specs/006-design/layers.md "Retired: the Layers panel");
# its two sub-articles land on the Layers article, which says what layers still do.
/canvas/layers-organising /canvas/layers/ 301
/canvas/layers-organising/ /canvas/layers/ 301
/canvas/layers-visibility-and-locking /canvas/layers/ 301
/canvas/layers-visibility-and-locking/ /canvas/layers/ 301
# The Tab Window element was retired on 2026-11-10 (docs/specs/009-elements/tab-window.md); its article's old URL lands
# on the Pages category, which holds the rest of the page features.
/pages/tab-windows /pages/ 301
/pages/tab-windows/ /pages/ 301

